  {
    "id": "1965252558630645871",
    "author": {
      "id": "1725169104963657728",
      "username": "AztecaAlpaca",
      "name": "阿兹特克小羊驼",
      "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2019350943930937348/0z3zAknf_400x400.jpg",
      "verified": false
    },
    "text": "这种心智的转变带来了前所未有的效率飞跃。Scott展示了一个令人兴奋的协作模式：\n\n一个开发者可同时分派多项任务，让AI分别并行推进，既减轻人力压力，也实现了高效分工协作的会议+产出并行模式。 人类不必再陷于繁琐的依赖升级、文档编写和前端微调中，而是可以放心地将这些任务异步交付给AI。 https://t.co/cuTDrn1rip",
    "created_at": "2025-09-09T03:14:57.000Z",
    "metrics": {
      "like_count": 0,
      "retweet_count": 0,
      "reply_count": null,
      "quote_count": null,
      "view_count": null,
      "impression_count": null
    },
    "media": [
      {
        "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G0X5_pwbgAEpkhZ.jpg",
        "type": "photo",
        "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G0X5_pwbgAEpkhZ.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "entities": {
      "urls": [],
