  {
    "id": "1965252545389232393",
    "author": {
      "id": "1725169104963657728",
      "username": "AztecaAlpaca",
      "name": "阿兹特克小羊驼",
      "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2019350943930937348/0z3zAknf_400x400.jpg",
      "verified": false
    },
    "text": "Cognition Labs的CEO Scott Wu的这篇访谈中没有描绘一个遥不可及的未来，而是手把手教我们如何拥抱当下。\n\n与AI共舞不是一场取代与被取代的零和博弈，而是一场关于分工、协作和成长的全新探索。当我们将AI视为团队中永不疲惫的实习生时，我们将获得无限的生产力与创造力。\n\nhttps://t.co/svE5XiitT1",
    "created_at": "2025-09-09T03:14:54.000Z",
    "metrics": {
      "like_count": 0,
      "retweet_count": 0,
      "reply_count": null,
      "quote_count": null,
      "view_count": null,
      "impression_count": null
    },
    "media": null,
    "entities": {
      "urls": [
        {
          "url": "https://t.co/svE5XiitT1",
          "indices": [
            144,
            167
          ],
          "display_url": "youtube.com/watch?v=7m_xKF…",
          "expanded_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7m_xKFqSxTo"
        }
      ],
      "hashtags": [],
      "mentions": []
    }
